<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT MOROCCO IN PENALTY SHOOTOUT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA BEAT MOROCCO IN PENALTY SHOOTOUT.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia beat Morocco 7-6 in a penalty shootout in the Hassan Trophy after they had ended the match at 2-2 (halftime 2-1) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Croatia - Goran Vlaiovic 14 and 15</p>
<p>Morocco - Salaheddine Bassir 22, Ahmed Bahja 72</p>
<p>Attendance - 80,000</p>
<p>Croatia will play the Czech Republic in the final later today.</p>
</text>
